{
  "scope": "New exact runtime utterances in this batch",
  "lines": [
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_senn_ask_again",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "You asked again.",
      "text_sha256": "80192b35a46317da4ab39757943ced7a71b9e12eed73bd91b32dbeeaf9807c60",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_senn_ask_again",
      "speaker_id": "captain_senn",
      "canonical_speaker": "senn",
      "text": "It takes longer than I expected.",
      "text_sha256": "aed3b0a92c3380b80240ce95b315e53ac75a4a379266df508a12a6b09e17f06d",
      "cast_role": "senn",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_senn_ask_again",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "We have time for a question.",
      "text_sha256": "22746fd3efc4e3feb00a4cfcda4c3bf72f7dccddbfc73801c73342962c0cbb5c",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_edric_poor_audience",
      "speaker_id": "edric",
      "canonical_speaker": "edric",
      "text": "I tried practicing with the door open once. Nobody came nearer.",
      "text_sha256": "b933a10693fc23edf101ce296003a08b386fe815237cb5c45ce5cba81b79a13d",
      "cast_role": "edric",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_edric_poor_audience",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "That is a review of sorts.",
      "text_sha256": "10f8645fc1e269326504d30346660e48c6b5ed27ff2bdaf2e9741f11c72605b2",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_edric_poor_audience",
      "speaker_id": "edric",
      "canonical_speaker": "edric",
      "text": "An unusually unanimous one. I had to laugh before I could close the door.",
      "text_sha256": "2ecda3c3cbb8e7ab57739a60f87fdde4bbebcd463c776d2affd67ebb4716a9ce",
      "cast_role": "edric",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_edric_poor_audience",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Did it help the playing?",
      "text_sha256": "c955147bb11cafef90b9eb6cbe6e3dc6a122a19a0b73e6b77d6febe851bcc0cd",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_edric_poor_audience",
      "speaker_id": "edric",
      "canonical_speaker": "edric",
      "text": "Not at all. It helped the practice.",
      "text_sha256": "7ebfeb25111d14b48be2d3137f75b11c9b3397c6ec198ba05d0fe5490b88f916",
      "cast_role": "edric",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_edric_poor_audience",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Then you had an audience after all.",
      "text_sha256": "86d79a7fa5fc26c690f73843e435c94ce9eff979cb3f3beac6de9e9bc2e6b38c",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_vale_keep_the_margin",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_record_keeper",
      "canonical_speaker": "vale",
      "text": "I wrote three lines this morning and crossed out two.",
      "text_sha256": "d6f7fb6e8d35aacb8fa1326e1082ee758b54d73db129acba2bb133bca5fcfeff",
      "cast_role": "vale",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_vale_keep_the_margin",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Are you keeping the third?",
      "text_sha256": "0b7f05070abcb93319cf9f9a2a7ce3303d4a362750996e1999df46c29f70518e",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_vale_keep_the_margin",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_record_keeper",
      "canonical_speaker": "vale",
      "text": "For now. It sounds rather pleased with itself.",
      "text_sha256": "4f5f5a8722a1c20a9c4474aab49068087c39eea639d02667897f8716773569c9",
      "cast_role": "vale",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_vale_keep_the_margin",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Must you correct that too?",
      "text_sha256": "3175b8b221a776c89f1444dcb00688355076ab32b2664e04add0752941b351ef",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_vale_keep_the_margin",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_record_keeper",
      "canonical_speaker": "vale",
      "text": "Perhaps tomorrow. I wanted to tell somebody I had written it.",
      "text_sha256": "07f0b14faf3c5b9550a5d5616839e0d83d44df0c0287bd6722d24af9cdc870c7",
      "cast_role": "vale",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_vale_keep_the_margin",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "I am glad you told me.",
      "text_sha256": "7263abdefb1d0d59e8eff6a6952feecba5a505a7772d5883f8835870235696ee",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_merrow_no_form",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_steward",
      "canonical_speaker": "merrow",
      "text": "I have nearly said 'while you wait' three times. You aren't waiting for anything, are you?",
      "text_sha256": "0de12627191c0d0f4b4c3f245582bb53b5b8180eb17fb1ea676193c6d1536dd1",
      "cast_role": "merrow",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_merrow_no_form",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "No.",
      "text_sha256": "38178a20b470cfd18299fb1593dd4ba706f1a83321dac051d01086efd8b7a96f",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_merrow_no_form",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_steward",
      "canonical_speaker": "merrow",
      "text": "Then I can finish this without finding a form for you.",
      "text_sha256": "c4e5348c959f5d8a81768cce78ecf6fdf1e46a830ba58bbed0f981088f3458fd",
      "cast_role": "merrow",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_merrow_no_form",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "You can.",
      "text_sha256": "471d182f02dccc43bb2ad08dcc982d8f5b60853986b51f60ece26dddca569847",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_merrow_no_form",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_steward",
      "canonical_speaker": "merrow",
      "text": "That was still warm. I had forgotten it could be.",
      "text_sha256": "d84e5e8a29e68bdf319fb61ca272a842f919bb1dbe78a8434a24dc8236bde52e",
      "cast_role": "merrow",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_merrow_no_form",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "You might try again tomorrow.",
      "text_sha256": "989ef6eac8698b6bce85006e391cad3fb94315e8f485b42fedbc7b10166b21a7",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nessa_guest_for_once",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "I am trying very hard not to ask whether you've eaten.",
      "text_sha256": "ac76c4cb7a96501491190fa3b19a1b71aa20d8f14882ef0b0f8872bf578c9ef7",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nessa_guest_for_once",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "I have. You may sit without feeding me.",
      "text_sha256": "abf2016bd8016398069d7a69a56c2ced7d5ca8d77a4ef77114843c15665a1545",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nessa_guest_for_once",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Good. Now I need something else to say.",
      "text_sha256": "58fb9256018ca6f31c53f8e685bf7778dbbc4ecaaf3259c823e6e26703a289ed",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nessa_guest_for_once",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Tell me about the badger.",
      "text_sha256": "c0ae3aed43d3f028c6ecfd93ed7b97f911b66a0a0cbde19648a59f8262ff05e4",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nessa_guest_for_once",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "An excellent piece of carving. Slightly round. Fierce in the right light.",
      "text_sha256": "757978c5592fb2454b07d11152aa8238488489c2c8aba1227cbcc2ac0b44fbdb",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nessa_guest_for_once",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "I look forward to meeting it.",
      "text_sha256": "4f8f26550ca653943b47a2599dc817e45da97445c877848a67e2e653582ce9a3",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nera_off_duty",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Nothing needs checking for a moment. I have checked that quite thoroughly.",
      "text_sha256": "aa87e9d365442e2cc78a6cc8dd6af279b28ad88d56ec098602677f9792c7ed20",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nera_off_duty",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "What happens now?",
      "text_sha256": "672946f614f0c7149632ce0afbdc09637e7e29869ec194e5a1df230009fef89a",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nera_off_duty",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "We stand here without discussing the crossing.",
      "text_sha256": "4f9190d7277ce1d185d3ae6c2f6c29dcbd8d10ab1d7b441f3207c0cf7e3ae051",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nera_off_duty",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "The wind has changed.",
      "text_sha256": "ec2dcc94263cd2cc301570b786cb91a91953c5b80f45aa8dcd05d33a1148706f",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nera_off_duty",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "So it has. That can be the whole conversation if we like.",
      "text_sha256": "101fdf8befa90861a87c1bd56de50b25a7d47c9ba87559805b9b9bce6e550ef5",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "world_scene:life2_nera_off_duty",
      "speaker_id": "player",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "I would like that.",
      "text_sha256": "77e091a74771c79c9f9e9cc5c1a0a7be72ec4930b2904fa76fde65d9af5d44d5",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nessa:greet",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Hot side of the tray. Other side of the argument.",
      "text_sha256": "948a4b0fe44a83693cb42c8dcda7c4bfeeeb31921b7785209cf7e377af6948b5",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nessa:joke",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "The small loaf is not a shortage. It's the one I dropped. There, a trade secret.",
      "text_sha256": "7ed3839de8b1d0b5873c353b51708b23f15ccb20048da38ec1af00d5fd280583",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nessa:reassure",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Set out another bowl. Worry does less harm with something to do.",
      "text_sha256": "2aee4c9644b3eb5226708fb49517b177d48b04db198ede4c0ce4689c924eb3a7",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nessa:work",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Weigh before you divide. Generosity that forgets the last household isn't generous.",
      "text_sha256": "bc6f886c980f9f20d299f38d805bd9fb50fa7ea8a76a8171538caa18af87687c",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nessa:apology",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "No one burned? Then give me room and we'll survive it.",
      "text_sha256": "2b38d09373118327f6fc8c65a6abc6977c6f3310a67cfc34998940267faffcc7",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:social_menu",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "A moment between jobs.",
      "text_sha256": "704cff016ba5e9ac6f0078f89823120f8895ab8c662579f8c8bbb232719336ef",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nera:greet",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Check the strap before leaning on the cart.",
      "text_sha256": "5c613e593c047994b938ec8be89aad47c1919d59286f1b7a4f04aa25008c10f0",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nera:joke",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "The cart has fewer opinions than the crew. More reliable brakes, too.",
      "text_sha256": "64fc1eb34ffc17a430bbb445198d88beef68a92c9c2679e1c93f1670e03fa8d7",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nera:reassure",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "You can take the next useful job. That's enough for now.",
      "text_sha256": "cfd9da74240e3a12c5338c28099fe9c46b302e620358548e15e8830d3df21e56",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nera:work",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "The load is tied to survive a turn, not to look tidy while standing still.",
      "text_sha256": "f2ef5083bce6d98ae172003a31dabae4deb3e9ce90ef63d20f497a2d5f78fa6b",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:nera:apology",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Keep the approach clear. People need a way through.",
      "text_sha256": "c8465ae4769bc86018de7c594e9864680324052a3f7e7fe1f3a82e5695801e46",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:social_menu",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "A moment between jobs.",
      "text_sha256": "704cff016ba5e9ac6f0078f89823120f8895ab8c662579f8c8bbb232719336ef",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:favour:cord",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I'll split it between the two still working. This short knot is spare; pull the turns apart when you want to learn how it holds.",
      "text_sha256": "87327afaf6cba414c2b39584c6927b25509dc5c44461f9a742d199e44d254c11",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:favour:parcel",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "No one has to give testimony for a meal. Keep the empty delivery sleeve; the names inside are mine to protect.",
      "text_sha256": "eff796a70c0800c525fea61565d30121b60479403bef6414c018248e0de52a1f",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "everyday:rumour:deep",
      "speaker_id": "nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Nessa has heard that every delayed load went into the old mill. Her own missing delivery does not prove that.",
      "text_sha256": "a102bdb0a633d1a7adc7f7f6ccec07b46cc8d4b8110e16422af97dcdf44870ca",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:greyfen:saga_nessa:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "The next batch needs water. Bread takes its time, however loudly people ask for it.",
      "text_sha256": "9e49c75244091ca1899e8dd318c9dbfaeb425232a06a1bc905a0a0e98c691d68",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:old_mill:mill_second_worker:line",
      "speaker_id": "mill_second_worker",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "I marked that load already. Check the tag before you move it.",
      "text_sha256": "d91e545085eb1cff949f0bc2356edb165498c46d8a3cc8d90ceb99c9b2e1ab2f",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:marsh_crossing:saga_nera:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Stop where it is firm. You can ask me from there.",
      "text_sha256": "2d6f1f34ab1006e519e4a4bc3090475f0600f5ac5ef4308011e9dd7dbf59a5b4",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:marsh_crossing:saga_nera:after_line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "A notch for daylight, a hood for night. Neither replaces looking where you step.",
      "text_sha256": "4d1f46fb48cf8ee31a7203a1a58b9ab8f705a0c5bd0385fd90a373ee1b8d78db",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:marsh_crossing:saga_nera:consequences:0:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "The captain is answering for his orders. I am still checking the crossing.",
      "text_sha256": "1c5ca3782b430d283ce97a07c2a8a53c7e3cf1888cfbfe39648e2f859c4c293e",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:marsh_crossing:saga_nera:consequences:1:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Senn has gone. The rope still needs checking before anyone crosses.",
      "text_sha256": "35a1db1959fe6bf15eda3d40ad6bc9c6b15078e0bc6d8d67f7c31882e89d815f",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:marsh_crossing:saga_nera:consequences:2:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Removing the captain did not mend a single board. Keep this approach clear.",
      "text_sha256": "615fce7a397acc0e934a76ae532019fb99d49ad1169ac07124f5c77357b34ae7",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:record_hall:edric:line",
      "speaker_id": "edric",
      "canonical_speaker": "edric",
      "text": "Read the answer before you bring me another seal.",
      "text_sha256": "4d4169abc76a26c1f70de555b2f45880ea3922aad831c95d11efaedc62b940c5",
      "cast_role": "edric",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "routine:vargan_court:vargan_servant:line",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_servant",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Leave room for the tray. People still have to eat while the great hall talks.",
      "text_sha256": "7be923fa30367a854152c1f933d0a24106324cf399bf43d24d474392071ab69f",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:greeting:saga_maren",
      "speaker_id": "saga_maren",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Hold that wheel, would you? The patient has had enough surprises for one journey.",
      "text_sha256": "67f6b509103f373335f4dd4947d619913dea5c76be6fcbab73d1382679547567",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:return:saga_maren",
      "speaker_id": "saga_maren",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "You can sit here. It is a seat, Kael. We needn't decide anything larger over supper.",
      "text_sha256": "969508944c2085d99041adb0cfa7eeafa6a3f84a2e2d1731dfb422517d71f76b",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:greeting:saga_nessa",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "I can bake less. I cannot tell a child a smaller loaf is the same size.",
      "text_sha256": "d33f49b56d2f903070be08824f42ad9eea0b58f783628d53ddcb2179a6ea9ba2",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:return:saga_nessa",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "There you are. Sit down a moment; I can talk without stopping the bread.",
      "text_sha256": "d501248faeb01e4c49d5f039a87dee8a7a83aee045e7147256267e8112751ada",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:greeting:saga_nera",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I closed the crossing. I can tell you why. I cannot tell you they all got home.",
      "text_sha256": "bb5acbf64a31a328505c34965a48cc4632bcc7b3644a2a452b9991c1cf30950e",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:return:saga_nera",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Firm ground this side. Catch your breath before you tell me what happened.",
      "text_sha256": "4b2039d3aaf85833f0419737d1b63985ad1d50983e1c8aafb74c6632a2656950",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_01:dialogue:hear_recognition",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I know you. You were on our escort. You left at the bend.",
      "text_sha256": "064087dc33d8230fe6c1116240bb882bea646e70b308eccdb00b2b62f22cb8e6",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_01:dialogue:hear_recognition",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I learned to set a wheel after that. We still needed to get somewhere.",
      "text_sha256": "75fc1b954090800b722330f61378fc53d1ffbe0f4184453e15735277c6d8b695",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_01:dialogue:hear_recognition",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "No. Follow the work line if you mean to help now. Toma knows where it crosses the old road. Do not tell me what I must want from you.",
      "text_sha256": "b75b39d4ddcd1a4f26e8e8cbde63cea0ef8d6703d06fa2c5e7e288b2b7ca5d1b",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_03:dialogue:hear_lift_plan",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Light crate to the left. Heavy one stays low. Tor says the frame will hold if someone seats that brace.",
      "text_sha256": "1f5c3fc7c52c98c90247dd5c0aa668f4a581d1fea31e69750baa9ef3ed65765f",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_03:dialogue:hear_lift_plan",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "There was no one left to do it for us. Mind your fingers.",
      "text_sha256": "50e52d3f3f756d14019094eb6a4c6192f8fb075021a8d9354270e86903e1aeb6",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_03:dialogue:hear_lift_plan",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Outside the load. Nobody proves anything by standing under a falling crate.",
      "text_sha256": "86981e2ba34c791ce0bdcb4704fd01266eff9312d7c1718882cef343c0d1638e",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_04:dialogue:check_last_load",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "All here. People first, then crates.",
      "text_sha256": "9038937ea2a412f61da866cf4aa2ae5ffdfe5da96938d267f024e7715a5aefe4",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_04:dialogue:check_last_load",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "That is what I asked. It does not change the other road.",
      "text_sha256": "2ef09dbbecb547e1e62472ac1de53e33c6893a7e40762f126af1b0e604572b43",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_04:dialogue:check_last_load",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Good. Help me get the rope dry.",
      "text_sha256": "0caa11ac318b9a0ef5c0cbda357df2a699beb5410acfc9db5e84ebd17b3c9752",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_05:dialogue:hear_boundary",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Keep what I gave you. Not a list of everyone who was there. Some of them do not want you finding them.",
      "text_sha256": "b73163caa4647f78d78284f899a4fda928f65e1cbdd2abf374fdfa8301d8ea4c",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_05:dialogue:hear_boundary",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Start with your own name, Kael. Mine is not the price of putting it there.",
      "text_sha256": "109f11a030f56f23d293aeca70f9377fb3fd0bbed4e3b0737870eefba3a2ecc4",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_06:dialogue_distance:return_home",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "The bread can stay by the gate. I am not ready to sit with you tonight.",
      "text_sha256": "7bbfc3cf297c48b16cca04ffc2019df7541e5cffcda4b11bd18932138d7f1e0e",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_06:dialogue_distance:return_home",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Thank you. That is all I asked. The next load leaves when I have chosen the route.",
      "text_sha256": "35448702f88b52037c679505b1deece98390c2e89503a8b71ef9911e5ced6983",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_06:dialogue:return_home",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Nessa packed too much bread. She says that is a problem for my judgment, not her baking.",
      "text_sha256": "acf2119459bd4386904d71757734c97a2021de2df5a09532047149b6bf21e9fa",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_06:dialogue:return_home",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I am still choosing. You needn't wait beside the door until I do.",
      "text_sha256": "fc1272829e6653c5a2df47e58cce3d563aff83c8abbb436ab52a08ba5e10b5d9",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:side_escort_06:dialogue:return_home",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "A seat, then. Nothing larger over supper.",
      "text_sha256": "b22cf4f95c22461eca156bdf03a70e5f0a5884a50059d5b48f7fb2b8064a9cb1",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:saga_gre_q01:account:hear_shortfall",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Nessa brushes flour off the counter. 'Yesterday that sack made twelve. Today it made nine. Same seam, same oven. Tell me which of those has learned to lie.'",
      "text_sha256": "85fb82da33ce0b500dbcc12c1cea59c69d02deee6ac9e288d9a20648fd885875",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:saga_gre_q05:account:meet_arrivals",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "A traveler: 'We heard the bell stopped. We didn't know if that meant the road was welcome.'",
      "text_sha256": "c07683b934feffe33924c3a32a5ec789125660896dc2914e1bf1d89170bdfaa5",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:saga_roa_q02:account:hear_closure",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Nera keeps her eyes on the post. 'I cut it. The rope was pulling me in. I wrote that the crossing failed. I did not write about my knife.'",
      "text_sha256": "7f4ec8ff6bf85bf5c6a4d1ec34255570dabe443b42e5901ae638ae3ce0f13f5e",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:nera:return",
      "speaker_id": "saga_maren",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "You corrected your own account. Mine says what I gave it, and no more. There is still a load to hand over after your business in the glade.",
      "text_sha256": "583c5dc843a5685506b98f17d8d2a5b28d8e744d9cf732d8aa9d1187b4c99a44",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:nera:return",
      "speaker_id": "saga_maren",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "All of us crossed. That matters. It is not the same as having come back for us then.",
      "text_sha256": "caa50d1106159ba4762c2747e1884a3b6c94e7ed3fda1c7a280fdb3abf1f78db",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:nera:return",
      "speaker_id": "saga_maren",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I have a crew to think about. Ask me about the work we are doing now, Kael. The old road is not going anywhere.",
      "text_sha256": "69a4fc3125e81ac329442c61b6166cc695ed1e4422f2f6479b132056de549113",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "regional:nera:parting:company",
      "speaker_id": "saga_maren",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Nera accepted company for the handover and kept her own plans. Kael completed the existing journey home; the next road is an offer, not proof of forgiveness.\n\nNera: 'The next route is mine to choose. Supper can just be supper.'",
      "text_sha256": "9a4d01aa2ae292c56aca82de6ea1c66553c820fd825ea447e9aaf008b915b3a5",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "living_cast"
    }
  ]
}
